{"unit_id": "tag:0F2L:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>为局部（locally）闭子集（closed subset）。在这种情形下，有时也使用“<MATH_0003>上的诱导的既约（reduced）概形（scheme）结构”这一说法。它指的是定义<REF_0001>中的诱导的既约（reduced）概形（scheme）结构，其中把<MATH_0004>看作开子概形（open subscheme）<MATH_0005>（取自<MATH_0006>）的闭子集（closed subset）。这里，<MATH_0007>是<MATH_0008>在<MATH_0009>的拓扑空间（topological space）中的“边界（boundary）”。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "locally", "target_term": "局部"}, {"source_term": "closed subset", "target_term": "闭子集"}, {"source_term": "reduced", "target_term": "既约"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "reduced", "target_term": "既约"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "open subscheme", "target_term": "开子概形"}, {"source_term": "closed subset", "target_term": "闭子集"}, {"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "boundary", "target_term": "边界"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "局部闭子集所在的对象"}, {"source_term": "locally", "target_term": "局部", "context": "限定子集的闭性"}, {"source_term": "closed subset", "target_term": "闭子集", "context": "受局部性限定的假设子集"}, {"source_term": "reduced", "target_term": "既约", "context": "此处术语中的结构性质"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "此处术语中的结构类型"}, {"source_term": "reduced", "target_term": "既约", "context": "所引定义中的结构性质"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "所引定义中的结构类型"}, {"source_term": "open subscheme", "target_term": "开子概形", "context": "在其中将指定子集视为闭集的环境"}, {"source_term": "closed subset", "target_term": "闭子集", "context": "指定子集在所取开子概形中的性质"}, {"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "在其中取边界的底层空间"}, {"source_term": "boundary", "target_term": "边界", "context": "子集在所指空间中的边界"}], "notes": []}
