{"unit_id": "tag:0356:proof", "translation": "假设<MATH_0001>（在集合（set）意义下）。设<MATH_0002>为<MATH_0003>的理想（ideal）层（sheaf）。任取仿射开集（affine opens）<MATH_0004>、<MATH_0005>，使得<MATH_0006>，并任取<MATH_0007>，则拉回（pullback）<MATH_0008>在任意<MATH_0009>的剩余域（residue field）中映为（maps）零（zero）。换言之，<MATH_0010>。由此推出<MATH_0011>，因为<MATH_0012>是既约（reduced）的（引理<REF_0001>及《代数（Algebra）》引理<REF_0002>）。因此，<MATH_0013>经由<MATH_0014>分解（factors through），见引理<REF_0003>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "ideal", "target_term": "理想"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "affine opens", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "pullback", "target_term": "拉回"}, {"source_term": "residue field", "target_term": "剩余域"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映为"}, {"source_term": "zero", "target_term": "零"}, {"source_term": "reduced", "target_term": "既约"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "factors through", "target_term": "分解"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "对假设解释所用的意义"}, {"source_term": "ideal", "target_term": "理想", "context": "以其层定义闭子概形的代数对象"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "闭子概形的定义数据"}, {"source_term": "affine opens", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "任取用于局部验证的开集"}, {"source_term": "pullback", "target_term": "拉回", "context": "在所给态射下拉回的对象"}, {"source_term": "residue field", "target_term": "剩余域", "context": "检验拉回截面是否在各点消失的域"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映为", "context": "拉回截面到剩余域的映射"}, {"source_term": "zero", "target_term": "零", "context": "拉回在剩余域中的取值"}, {"source_term": "reduced", "target_term": "既约", "context": "由在各点消失推出结论所用的性质"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "所引代数引理所属的章名"}, {"source_term": "factors through", "target_term": "分解", "context": "证明得到的态射性质"}], "notes": []}
